# Defense in depth in case this folder ever ends up under a web-servable
# path — backup_db.php's default backup_dir (backend/backups) already
# sits outside backend/api/, but a real Hostinger deploy should still
# place it entirely outside public_html. See docs/DEPLOY_HOSTINGER.md.
Require all denied
<IfModule !mod_authz_core.c>
  Order deny,allow
  Deny from all
</IfModule>
